{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sebevrah is a single-player first-person shooter focused on dual-wield gameplay, set in a dark period during the Fourth World War. It features upgrades with unique visuals, a custom chatbot that interacts with the environment, Minecraft-style crafting, a Tarkov-style health system, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyelements</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 weapons if I'm not mistaken I already forgot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual-wield-focused gameplay.- Weapons are designed to behave differently when used in one hand or with both. That\u2019s why picking up an RPG and an M60 at the same time might not always be a great idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry \u2014 everything can be upgraded, and it\u2019s all about choosing the right weapons to dual-wield and which ones to handle with both hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each weapon has at least 10 upgrades including a character with a visual change</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom chatbot (not ChatGPT or anything like that \u2014 just an algorithm for searching in maps or prewritten info).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophisticated health system of bleeding or brain injuries, I take pills but try not to overdose on them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >changing the aiming angles of weapons, you can aim in different directions in dual wield, not only at the center of the screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'll add another later</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4146470?t=1762806467","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146470/c7b11bed47e91d357b0e9cc4f1294ef536105d1a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762806467","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146470/5c049cf79a43fd41fdda7cc3