e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom chatbot (not ChatGPT or anything like that \u2014 just an algorithm for searching in maps or prewritten info).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophisticated health system of bleeding or brain injuries, I take pills but try not to overdose on them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >changing the aiming angles of weapons, you can aim in different directions in dual wield, not only at the center of the screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'll add another later</p></li></ul>","developers":["The Only Way Out"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146470/61a60e4eefb4576d6e6392b4839896373ec0a0bc/header.jpg?t=1762806467","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4146470/1131774916/9b86878291407a026344145f73621d964cb89b85/1761786056/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762806462","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4146470/1131774916/9b86878291407a026344145f73621d964cb89b85/1761786056/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762806462","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4146470/1131774916/9b86878291407a026344145f73621d964cb89b85/1761786056/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762806462","id":257224400,"name":"PromoTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224400/c41f74a2fbdd4c90889983c517bf154e272d0e18/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762806462"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4146470/779641523/2f5ce9866eef73b269eb6589dc1a6cfbab3a33ba/1761773513/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762806463","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4146470/779641523/2f5ce9866eef73b269eb6589dc1a6cfbab3a33ba/1761773513/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762806463","